  {
   "type": "text",
   "x": 890.64,
   "y": 330,
   "width": 666.6,
   "height": 151.25,
   "text": "kubementat.py     install \u2502 uninstall \u2502 setup-secrets      \u2192  Automation\nconfig.py         init \u2502 add \u2502 set \u2502 unset \u2502 show \u2502 validate  \u2192  config_init \u00b7 _bootstrap \u00b7 _validate\ntekton.py         setup-* \u2502 generate-* \u2502 run \u2502 list \u2502 cleanup  \u2192  Automation + TektonUtils\nkubernetes.py     analyze \u2502 capacity \u2502 pvc-usage \u2502 logs \u2502 exec \u2502 secret  \u2192  KubernetesUtils\nhelm.py           version \u2502 apply                      \u2192  HelmUtils\ncomponent.py      install \u2502 uninstall                  \u2192  HelmUtils\nrouting.py        status \u2502 install                     \u2192  TraefikPresence \u00b7 install_routing()\nusers.py          create/delete team \u2502 grafana accounts \u2192  Automation \u00b7 grafana_accounts\ntunnels.py        grafana \u2502 tekton \u2502 openbao \u2502 pod      \u2192  Automation \u00b7 KubernetesUtils\nenvironments.py   list                                 \u2192  EnvironmentRegistry\nutilities.py      run-ci-container \u2502 create-ingress    \u2192  CiUtils \u00b7 IngressGenerator",
